{"ref":"BDB, תָּאַר","hw":"תָּאַר","html":"† <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">תָּאַר</span></big></big>  <strong>vb.</strong> appar. <strong>incline (</strong>perhaps akin to <span dir=\"rtl\">תּוּר</span> Thes; > Buhl denom. from <span dir=\"rtl\">תֹּאַר</span>, q.v.<strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">ת׳</span>, subj. <em>boundary:</em> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 18:14\" href=\"/Joshua.18.14\">Jos 18:14</a>, c. ה loc. <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:9\" href=\"/Joshua.15.9\">15:9b</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:11\" href=\"/Joshua.15.11\">11</a>; c. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span> … <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span> v <a data-ref=\"Joshua 18:9\" href=\"/Joshua.18.9\">9a</a>; c. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span> only, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 18:17\" href=\"/Joshua.18.17\">18:17</a>; prob. also c. acc. loc. <a data-ref=\"Joshua 19:13\" href=\"/Joshua.19.13\">19:13</a> (read <span dir=\"rtl\">רִמּ֫וֹנָה וְתָאַר הַנֵּעָה</span> <em>to Rimmon, and it inclined to Neʿa</em> Di Steuern Benn al.). Vid. also [<a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, תֹּ֫אַר\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_תֹּ֫אַר\">תָּאַר</a>] <strong>Pi.</strong> infr.","next":"BDB, תֹּ֫אַר","prev":"BDB, תַּאֲנַת שִׁלֹ֑ה"}